## SUMMARY TABLE FOR NEW `PeriodComparePage`

| Aspect | Pattern |
|--------|---------|
| **ViewModel** | `@MainActor @Observable` final class, init takes read models + seams, `start()/stop()/refresh()` methods |
| **Core Import** | **NO** `import Shared` — sources are app-level, feature-views stays decoupled |
| **Async Handling** | Swift concurrency `async/await` via seam protocols (`async -> Bool` for mutations, callbacks for data updates) |
| **State Model** | `@Observable` read-model(s) subscribing to source(s); `@ObservationIgnored` seams; derived computed properties |
| **Vehicles** | `[Vehicle]` model injected at init; in production, loaded by source from KMP core, in previews hardcoded |
| **Analytics/Period-Stats** | Analogous `PeriodCompareSource` protocol; fetched via core's HTTP client in `start()`, snapshot pushed via callback |
| **Diagnostics** | `SurfaceSlug` enum, `reportOpen(to: telemetry)` in `start()`, emits `view.opened` with non-identifying slug string |
| **Navigation** | Add to `AppRoute` enum only if integrating into main app; otherwise lives standalone in `feature-views/` |
| **Previews** | In-memory sources, `.echo` localizer, sample fixture data, multiple state snapshots (loading/empty/error/content) |
| **Tests** | `@MainActor` XCTest, `makeViewModel()` factory, fake mutators with spy recording, snapshot assertions |

